":"بٍينُن مَرِفِ شَ لْشْي شُنفبٍ مَفَاشُشِ شَ عَ لِ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"نَ كُي، نَشَن يٌ نَ عَلَتَلَ شِلِ، نَ كَنيِ كِسِمَ نّ.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"مِشِ كِسِشِيٍ لُمَ نّ سِيٌنِ نُن دَرِ سَلَمُ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"عَلْ عَلَتَلَ عَ مَسٍنشِ كِ نَشّ.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"عَلَتَلَ كِسِ رَفِرِشِ نَشٍيٍ مَ، نٍيٍ لُمَ نّ كِسِ مِشِيٍ دْنشْي يَ مَ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/sus_apb/JOL/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/sus_apb/JOL/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/sus_apb/JOL/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}